ChatScan, the CDCI JSON-RPC client, the local sealer (daemon), and the
ChatScan SDK in this directory are copied from:

  https://github.com/crypterchat/chatscan

MIT License — see backend/chatscan/LICENSE.

github.com/Centraldb/CDCI and github.com/Centraldb/Daemon are not publicly
cloneable. This site therefore runs ChatScan's local sealer as the chain
daemon, and talks to a real `centraldatabased` node only when CDCI_RPC_URL
is set.
